{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shiyi-e-e8af6c115dc263e25e67","title":"孙权命胡综作黄龙大牙赋","accounts":[{"id":"shiyi-a-e8af6c115dc263e25e67","label":"正文","text":"孙权命胡综作黄龙大牙赋","evidence":["shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","shiyi-q-382f10355201b84c3b77","shiyi-q-1ad5bbb7d7d1b380a5a3","shiyi-q-c93d3de9508fa2a6a05d","shiyi-q-2e7cd31fa6562612e800","shiyi-q-f82514db78fb35d813b6","shiyi-q-a2ce4610a56c7d067517"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"命作赋者","evidence":["shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","shiyi-q-382f10355201b84c3b77","shiyi-q-1ad5bbb7d7d1b380a5a3","shiyi-q-c93d3de9508fa2a6a05d","shiyi-q-2e7cd31fa6562612e800","shiyi-q-f82514db78fb35d813b6","shiyi-q-a2ce4610a56c7d067517"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0091","role":"作赋者","evidence":["shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","shiyi-q-382f10355201b84c3b77","shiyi-q-1ad5bbb7d7d1b380a5a3","shiyi-q-c93d3de9508fa2a6a05d","shiyi-q-2e7cd31fa6562612e800","shiyi-q-f82514db78fb35d813b6","shiyi-q-a2ce4610a56c7d067517"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","shiyi-q-382f10355201b84c3b77","shiyi-q-1ad5bbb7d7d1b380a5a3","shiyi-q-c93d3de9508fa2a6a05d","shiyi-q-2e7cd31fa6562612e800","shiyi-q-f82514db78fb35d813b6","shiyi-q-a2ce4610a56c7d067517"]},"ordering_evidence":"shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","order":10817}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0091","name":"胡综","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-090a857c07af13376f95","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-10e858eec5c942f4e431","layer":"original","quote":"黄武八年，夏，黄龙现夏口；于是权称尊号，因瑞改元〖1〗。又作黄龙大牙〖2〗，常在中军；诸军进退，视其所向。命综作赋曰：","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-1ad5bbb7d7d1b380a5a3","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-d67c693698cfee864251","layer":"original","quote":"黄、农创代〖8〗，拓定皇基；上顺天心，下息民灾。高辛诛共〖9〗，舜征有苗〖10〗；启有甘师〖11〗，汤有鸣条〖12〗；周之牧野〖13〗，汉之垓下〖14〗：靡不由兵〖15〗，克定厥绪。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-2e7cd31fa6562612e800","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-4637a4f1c3fce05e8655","layer":"original","quote":"乃律天时〖21〗，制为神军；取象太一〖22〗，五将三门〖23〗。疾则如电，迟则如云；进止有度，约而不烦。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-382f10355201b84c3b77","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-55be60a594aa7a6ce199","layer":"original","quote":"乾坤肇立〖3〗，三才是生〖4〗。狼、弧垂象〖5〗，实惟兵精〖6〗。圣人观法，是效是营〖7〗；始作器械，爰求厥成。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-a2ce4610a56c7d067517","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-149c84914df6ff8c31d2","layer":"original","quote":"在昔周室，赤乌衔书〖28〗；今也大吴，黄龙吐符〖29〗。合契河、洛〖30〗，动与道俱〖31〗；天赞人和，佥曰惟休〖32〗！","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-c93d3de9508fa2a6a05d","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1f4f94d3f56a6e920a52","layer":"original","quote":"明明大吴，实天生德；神武是经，惟皇之极。乃自在昔，黄、虞是祖〖16〗；越历五代〖17〗，继世在下。应期受命〖18〗，发迹南土；将恢大繇〖19〗，革我区夏〖20〗。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-f82514db78fb35d813b6","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-3d80d0f52239b6121630","layer":"original","quote":"四灵既布〖24〗，黄龙处中；周制日月，实曰太常〖25〗。杰然特立，六军所望。仙人在上，鉴观四方；神实使之，为国休祥〖26〗。军欲转向，黄龙先移；金鼓不鸣，寂然变施〖27〗。暗谟若神，可谓秘奇。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
